    "profile": "Builds the modelling a brief needs and reports its limits plainly: gradient boosting (XGBoost churn), LSTM time-series forecasting with time-ordered validation, text clustering (SBERT, K-Means, DBSCAN) and 11,459 per-gene models (train Pearson 0.807 vs test 0.545). Works with clients: scoped a loosely defined brief at 180 Degrees Consulting into a stakeholder demo (5-star rating) and contributed to the client's production MCP server, now in live use. Deploys on AWS and GCP (Lambda, Cloud Run) with CI/CD and MLflow experiment tracking. Owns data workflows end-to-end in Python and SQL, from merging structured, API and web-scraped data through feature creation, tuning, validation and deployment (Docker, GitHub Actions CI/CD, MLflow, AWS Lambda).",
